<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Freshora – fresh vegetables at your door</title><style>:root{--bg:#f2f5ef;--surface:#fff;--ink:#17261b;--mute:#5d6b60;--line:#dbe3d6;--leaf:#1f6a3a;--leaf-ink:#fff;--hot:#d6432a;--chip:#e3ecdf}
