<label class="pay"><input type="radio" name="pm" value="Cash on delivery"><span>Cash on delivery<small>Pay when your order arrives</small></span></label>
<div class="card" id="upiBox"><p style="margin:0 0 10px">Pay <b id="upiAmt"></b> to <b id="upiId"></b>, then place your order.</p><a class="btn" id="upiBtn" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none">Open UPI app</a></div>
